//--------------------
// Aligner sticky
// - Must not capture G bit
//   SP format 1X.XX G bit is [40]
//   SP format 01.XX G bit is [39]
//   SP format 00.1X G bit is [38]
//   DP format 1X.XX G bit is [11]
//   DP format 01.XX G bit is [10]
//   DP format 00.1X G bit is [09]
//--------------------

